    <sys:String x:Key="Behavior.LanguageDetail">자동은 Windows 표시 언어를 따르며, 지원하지 않는 언어면 영어로 표시합니다.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Behavior.Language.Auto">자동</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Behavior.Language.Korean">한국어</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Behavior.Language.English">English</sys:String>
